    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Recipe chat\nChat for the recipe pipeline. You type a request; steps 1 and 2 run here once. If step 2 reports a style mismatch the chat asks whether to keep the style you named or take the best fit, then it calls `POST /webhook/recipe-pipeline` with the brief and the chosen `style` (`brief_id` `chat`), shows the sheet and offers to accept it (recipe becomes `final`). A failed run shows the failed step and its error.\n\nChat URL: `http://localhost:5678/webhook/156cfa67-fd3e-5724-836b-f2fa5fac82ab/chat` (the workflow must be published; the *Chat* node also shows it). It needs an n8n login (User Auth): a private window with no login is refused.\n\nA run takes several minutes; the chat waits for it.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
